[{"title":"沁园春","author":"戴复古","text":"请赋林堂，林堂未成，吾何赋哉。\n想胸中丘壑，山中风月，亭台几所，花木千栽。\n应接光阴，品题胜概，须待堂成我再来。\n听分付，是经行去处，莫放苍苔。\n吾曹不堕尘埃。\n要胸次长随笑口开。\n任江湖浪迹，鸥盟雁序，功名到手，凤阁鸾台。\n它日相寻，有逾此约，酌水浮君三百杯。\n闻斯语，有冠山突兀，袍岭崔嵬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31634,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 代作","author":"戴复古","text":"误入风尘门户，驱来花月楼台。\n樽前几度得徘徊。\n可怜容易别，不见牡丹开。\n莫恨银瓶酒尽，但将妾泪添杯。\n江头恰限北风回。\n再三相祝去，千万寄书来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31635,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳梢青 岳阳楼","author":"戴复古","text":"袖剑飞吟。\n洞庭青草，秋水深深。\n万顷波光，岳阳楼上，一快披襟。\n不须携酒登临。\n问有酒、何人共斟。\n变尽人间，君山一点，自古如今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31636,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞仙歌","author":"戴复古","text":"卖花担上，菊蕊金初破。\n说着重阳怎虚过。\n看画城，簇簇酒肆歌楼，奈没个、巧处安排着我。\n家乡煞远哩，抵死思量，枉把眉头万千锁。\n一笑且开怀，小阁团栾，旋簇着、几般蔬果。\n把三杯两盏记时光，问有甚曲儿，好唱一个？","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31637,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝英台近 别李择之诸丈后途中寄此","author":"戴复古","text":"泛杭川，临尘水。\n几日共游戏。\n歌笑开怀，酒醒又还醉。\n奈何一旦分携，连宵风雨，剪不断、客愁千里。\n水云际。\n遥望一片飞鸿，苦是失群地。\n满眼春风，管甚闲桃李。\n此行归老家山，相逢难又，但一味、相思而已。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31638,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 兄弟争涂田而讼，歌此词主和议","author":"戴复古","text":"蜗角争多少。\n是英雄、割据乾坤，到头休了。\n一片泥涂荒草地，尽是鱼龙故道。\n新堤上、风涛难保。\n沧海桑田何时变，怕桑田、未变人先老。\n休为此，生烦恼。\n讼庭不许频频到。\n这官坊、翻来覆去，有何分晓。\n无诤人中为第一，长讼元非吉兆。\n但有恨、平章不早。\n尊酒唤回和气在，看从来、兄弟依然好。\n把前事，付一笑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31639,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其三 丰真州建江淮伟观楼","author":"戴复古","text":"百尺连云起。\n试登临、江山人物，一时俱伟。\n旁挹金陵龙虎势，京岘诸峰对峙。\n隐隐接、扬州歌吹。\n雪浪舞从三峡下，乍逢迎、海若谈秋水。\n形胜地，有如此。\n使君一世经纶志。\n把风斤月斧，来此等闲游戏。\n见说楼成无多日，大手一何容易。\n笑天下、纷纷血指。\n酝酿春风与和气，举长江、变作香醪美。\n人共乐，醉桃李。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31640,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其二 寄丰真州","author":"戴复古","text":"忆把金罍酒。\n叹别来、光阴荏苒，江湖宿留。\n世事不堪频着眼，赢得两眉长皱。\n但东望、故人翘首。\n木落山空天远大，送飞鸿、北去伤怀久。\n天下事，公知否。\n钱塘风月西湖柳。\n渡江来、百年机会，从前未有。\n唤起东山丘壑梦，莫惜风霜老手。\n要整顿、封疆如旧。\n早晚枢庭开幕府，是英雄、尽为公奔走。\n看金印，大如斗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31641,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其一 为真玉堂寿","author":"戴复古","text":"说与黄花道。\n九秋深、三光五岳，气钟英表。\n金马玉堂真学士，蕴藉诗书奥妙。\n一一是、经纶才调。\n斟酌古今来活国，算忠言、谠论知多少。\n又入奏，金门晓。\n朝回问寝披萱草。\n对高堂长说，一片君恩难报。\n更待痴儿千载遇，膝下十分荣耀。\n趁绿鬓、朱颜不老。\n整顿乾坤济时了，奉板舆、拜国夫人号。\n可谓忠，可谓孝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31642,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"戴复古","text":"病起无聊倚绣床。\n玉容清瘦懒梳妆。\n水沈烟冷橘花香。\n说个话儿方有味，吃些酒子又何妨。\n一声啼鴂断人肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31643,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其一 寄钦州刘叔冶史君","author":"戴复古","text":"羊城旧路。\n檀板一声惊客去。\n不拟重来。\n白发飘飘上越台。\n故人居处。\n曲巷深深通竹所。\n问讯桃花。\n欲访刘郎不在家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31644,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其二 寄五羊钟子洪","author":"戴复古","text":"天台狂客。\n醉里不知秋鬓白。\n应接风光。\n忆在江亭醉几场。\n吴姬劝酒。\n唱得廉颇能饭否。\n西雨东晴。\n人道无情又有情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31645,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其三","author":"戴复古","text":"阻风中酒。\n流落江湖成白首。\n历尽艰关。\n赢得虚名在世间。\n浩然归去。\n忆着石屏茅屋趣。\n想见山村。\n树有交柯犊有孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31646,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望江南 其一","author":"戴复古","text":"壶山好，博古又通今。\n结屋三间藏万卷，挥毫一字直千金。\n四海有知音。\n门外路，咫尺是湖阴。\n万柳堤边行处乐，百花洲上醉时吟。\n不负一生心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31647,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望江南 其三","author":"戴复古","text":"石屏老，家住海东云。\n本是寻常田舍子，如何呼唤作诗人。\n无益费精神。\n千首富，不救一生贫。\n贾岛形模元自瘦，杜陵言语不妨村。\n谁解学西昆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31648,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐 嘲人","author":"戴复古","text":"醉狂痴作。\n误信青楼约。\n酒醒梅花吹画角。\n翻得一场寂寞。\n相如谩赋凌云。\n琴台不遇文君。\n江上琵琶旧曲，只堪分付商人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31649,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐 兴国军呈李司直","author":"戴复古","text":"今朝欲去。\n忽有留人处。\n说与江头杨柳树。\n系我扁舟且住。\n十分酒兴诗肠。\n难禁冷落秋光。\n借取春风一笑，狂夫到老犹狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31650,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"戴复古","text":"太守风流，何人似、金华仙伯。\n试看取、珠篇玉句，银钩铁画。\n叶叶柳眉齐抹翠，梢梢花脸争匀白。\n比池塘、春草梦来诗，尤奇绝。\n胸中有，蛾眉月。\n笔头带，蓬□雪。\n笑归来万里，不登金阙。\n鹿瑞堂前冬日暖，螺山江上春波阔。\n但伤时、一念不能休，添华发。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31651,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 赤壁怀古","author":"戴复古","text":"赤壁矶头，一番过、一番怀古。\n想当时、周郎年少，气吞区宇。\n万骑临江貔虎噪，千艘列炬鱼龙怒。\n卷长波、一鼓困曹瞒，今如许。\n江上渡，江边路。\n形胜地，兴亡处。\n览遗踪，胜读史书言语。\n几度东风吹世换，千年往事随潮去。\n问道傍、杨柳为谁春，摇金缕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31652,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳 元夕上邵武王守子文","author":"戴复古","text":"草木生春，楼台不夜，团团月上云霄。\n太平官府，民物共逍遥。\n指点江梅一笑，几番负、雨秀风娇。\n今年好，花边把酒，歌舞醉元宵。\n风流，贤太守，青云志气，玉树丰标。\n是神仙班里，旧日王乔。\n出奉板舆行乐，金莲照、十里笙箫。\n收灯后，看看丹诏，催入圣明朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31653,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳 其一 楚州上巳万柳池应监丞领客","author":"戴复古","text":"三日春光，群贤胜践，山阴何似山阳。\n鹅池墨妙，曲水记流觞。\n自许风流丘壑，何人共、击楫长江。\n新亭上，山河有异，举目恨堂堂。\n使君，经世志，十年边上，两鬓风霜。\n问池边杨柳，因甚凄凉。\n万树重新种了，株株在、桃李花傍。\n仍须待，剩栽兰芷，为国洗河湟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31654,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锦帐春 淮东陈提举清明奉母夫人游徐仙翁庵","author":"戴复古","text":"处处逢花，家家插柳。\n政寒食、清明时候。\n奉板舆行乐，使星随后。\n人间稀有。\n出郭寻仙，绣衣春昼。\n马上列、两行红袖。\n对韶华一笑，劝国夫人酒。\n百千长寿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31655,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙 周子俊过南昌，问讯宋吉甫、黄存之昆仲","author":"戴复古","text":"西山岩壑，东湖亭馆，尽是经行旧路。\n别时方见有荷花，还又见、梅花岁暮。\n宋家兄弟，黄家兄弟，一一烦君传语。\n相忘不寄一行书，元自有、不相忘处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31656,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙","author":"戴复古","text":"新荷池沼，绿槐庭院。\n檐外雨声初断。\n喧喧两部乱蛙鸣，怎得似、啼莺睍睆。\n风光流转。\n客游汗漫。\n莫问鬓丝长短。\n即时杯酒醉时歌，算省得、闲愁一半。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31657,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉太平","author":"戴复古","text":"长亭短亭。\n春风酒醒。\n无端惹起离情。\n有黄鹂数声。\n芙蓉绣茵。\n江山画屏。\n梦中昨夜分明。\n悔先行一程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31658,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉落魄 九日吴胜之运使黄鹤山登高","author":"戴复古","text":"龙山行乐。\n何如今日登黄鹤。\n风光政要人酬酢。\n欲赋归来，莫是渊明错。\n江山登览长如昨。\n飞鸿影里秋光薄。\n此怀祗有黄花觉。\n牢裹乌纱，一任西风作。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31659,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 题赵次山鱼乐堂","author":"戴复古","text":"圉圉洋洋各自由。\n或行或舞或沈浮。\n观鱼未必知鱼乐，政恐清波照白头。\n休结网，莫垂钩。\n机心一露使鱼愁。\n终知不是池中物，掉尾江湖汗漫游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31660,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"戴复古","text":"每遇花时人竞取，祇愁斫尽春风枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31661,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"戴复古","text":"就中一种芙蓉别，只恐鹅黄学道妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31662,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"戴复古","text":"槎牙老树得春早，摘索好枝和雪攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31663,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝英台近","author":"戴复古妻","text":"惜多才，怜薄命，无计可留汝。\n揉碎花笺，忍写断肠句。\n道傍杨柳依依，千丝万缕，抵不住、一分愁绪。\n如何诉。\n便教缘尽今生，此身已轻许。\n捉月盟言，不是梦中语。\n后回君若重来，不相忘处，把杯酒、浇奴坟土。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31664,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幽居","author":"戴某","text":"幽栖才一室，意足便为安。\n片石星霜老，八窗风月寒。\n已无蜗角累，自号鹿门看。\n清夜谁同语，横琴试一弹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31665,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天台道上早行","author":"戴炳","text":"箯舆轧轧过清溪，溪上梅花压水低。\n月影渐收天半晓，两山相对竹鸡啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31666,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜过鉴湖","author":"戴炳","text":"推篷四望水连空，一片蒲帆正饱风。\n山际白云云际月，子规声在白云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31667,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赏茶","author":"戴炳","text":"自汲香泉带落花，漫烧石鼎试新茶。\n绿阴天气闲庭院，卧听黄蜂报晚衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31668,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏曼卿作新楼扁曰潇湘片景来求拙画且索诗","author":"戴炳","text":"有此一楼足，悠然万虑忘。\n拓开风月地，压断水云乡。\n四野留春色，千峰明夕阳。\n眼前无限景，何处认潇湘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31669,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其三","author":"戴栩","text":"澶漫山东二百州，君恩如水向东流。\n楼前立仗看宣赦，白璧黄金万户侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31670,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其十","author":"戴栩","text":"曲江汀滢水平杯，便觉春光四面来。\n荀令凤池文杏别，先于门外百花开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31671,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其五","author":"戴栩","text":"翔鸾阙下谢恩初，玉印前头卤簿车。\n每日请来金凤纸，修成几卷太平书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31672,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其七","author":"戴栩","text":"去年沙觜是江心，近日汀洲绿菼深。\n龙伯驱风不敢上，杨花不动树阴阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31673,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其二","author":"戴栩","text":"后汉今周喜再昌，无人金阙议边兵。\n二仪清浊还高下，万国笙歌醉太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31674,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其九","author":"戴栩","text":"十二楼头花正繁，朝回环佩五云间。\n金鳞不动春塘满，天上仙人爱静閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31675,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其四","author":"戴栩","text":"河北将军尽入朝，九重春色醉仙桃。\n沿边千里浑无事，云捲长天圣日高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31676,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其六","author":"戴栩","text":"今春喜气满乾坤，应有蒲轮辗白云。\n恩与内分金带赤，草堂焉敢更移文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31677,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其一","author":"戴栩","text":"赤墀黄阁自从容，人咏元和第一功。\n万象晓归仁寿镜，旌旗初下玉关东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31678,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上丞相寿 其八","author":"戴栩","text":"万岁千秋奉明主，坐令四海如虞唐。\n一门累叶凌烟阁，功业汾阳异姓王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31679,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五月一日出局偶书","author":"戴栩","text":"坐局无营饭又茶，楚骚词里记年华。\n小窗不厌经宵雨，红到葵梢第一花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31680,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙都示马令克","author":"戴栩","text":"钓鱼自荐桃花饭，借曲新篘竹叶醪。\n一段清贫眼中见，定非装点入诗骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31681,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永康道中 其二","author":"戴栩","text":"油笠芒鞋筇一枝，晚秋天气半春时。\n雨多樵径行人少，山崦青红叫画眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31682,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永康道中 其一","author":"戴栩","text":"涨渌无风影自摇，芡花生刺藕花娇。\n山禽不记春归去，深树一声婆饼焦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31683,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永康道中 其三","author":"戴栩","text":"泥沙过迥人家少，烟树几行山一围。\n渐近界牌听唤酒，柳塘春水鹭鸶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31684,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次赵常博题净慈僧昙印得御书真赞","author":"戴栩","text":"黄纸书涵雨露恩，春风寂寂闭岩门。\n松间时有神光现，不是孤园礼世尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31685,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛舍利塔","author":"戴栩","text":"海天五月气阴清，单绤无功絮有情。\n踏半浮屠见沧海，风摇铃铎是商声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31686,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官满寓济川馆得叶嘉仲和朱宰梅花诗次韵云作梅花诗当用欧公雪中酬唱今凡诗家常用字一切屏去乃佳朱令君仆未识面见足下道其语差强人意又与斯君德润善乃赓此诗以兴譬诸草木吾臭味也 其四","author":"戴栩","text":"伊谁同岁晚，怀抱向君开。\n烟雨閟芳信，望君来不来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31687,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官满寓济川馆得叶嘉仲和朱宰梅花诗次韵云作梅花诗当用欧公雪中酬唱今凡诗家常用字一切屏去乃佳朱令君仆未识面见足下道其语差强人意又与斯君德润善乃赓此诗以兴譬诸草木吾臭味也 其三","author":"戴栩","text":"爱日经檐煖，游蜂扑纸窗。\n吾生岂拘束，一笑俯涛江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31688,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官满寓济川馆得叶嘉仲和朱宰梅花诗次韵云作梅花诗当用欧公雪中酬唱今凡诗家常用字一切屏去乃佳朱令君仆未识面见足下道其语差强人意又与斯君德润善乃赓此诗以兴譬诸草木吾臭味也 其五","author":"戴栩","text":"饥雀啄芳蕾，蠹苔侵碧枝。\n是中浑不较，刻画未嫌时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenan